          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwondũ wa ũu ĩw’a, we Isilaeli, sũvĩa wĩke ũu; nĩ kana kwĩthĩwe ũseo kwaku, nĩ kana mũtonye kwingĩva mũno, o tondũ Yeova, Ngai wa aaĩthe maku, wakwathie, mwĩ nthĩ yusũĩte ĩia na ũkĩ wa nzũkĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
