        },
        {
          "text": "Na kũkeethĩwa, yĩla Yeova Ngai waku wĩkũtwaa nthĩ ĩla wevĩtĩe aaĩthe maku, Avalaamu, na Isaka, na Yakovo, ũkũnenga, ndũa nene na nzeo, ila ũtaaka we, ",
