              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nĩvo ĩndĩ ũkamwĩa mwana waku, Twaĩ ngombo sya Valao nthĩ ya Misili: na Yeova atumya Misili na kw’oko kwĩ vinya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Yeova oonan’ya syama na moseng’yo manene na me woo, ĩũlũ wa Misili, na Valao, na nyũmba yake yonthe twene na metho maitũ; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
